<title>USA: Indah Kiat Finance sells $600 mln 144a notes.</title>
<headline>Indah Kiat Finance sells $600 mln 144a notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following 144a debt issue from Indah Kiat Finance Mauritius Ltd was priced on Thursday via Morgan Stanley, Dean Witter, Discover &amp; Co, according to a syndicate official.</p>
<p>The notes are guaranteed by PT Indah Kiat Pulp &amp; Paper Corp and the issue was increased in size to $600 million from an original size of $500 million.</p>
<p>BORROWER INDAH KIAT FINANCE MAURITIUS LTD</p>
<p>AMT $600 MLN	   COUPON 10.00 PCT  MATURITY 7/1/2007</p>
<p>TYPE SNR UNSEC NOTES ISS PRICE 99.347  FIRST PAY DATE 1/1/1998 LAST MOODY'S  BA3    YIELD 10.105	PAY FREQ  SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BB-MINUS    SPREAD 362.5 BP   CALLABLE NON-CALL FIVE</p>
<p>NOTE: The notes were sold with registration rights.</p>
<p>((U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212-859-1678 ))</p>
</text>
